            "review_title": "Review at East West Brewing Co.",
            "review_text": "Craig M\nDundee, United Kingdom594 contributions\n0\nNice food and beers\nJul 2026 • Couples\nWe visited here for dinner one night, during our stay in Da Nang. We hadn't booked and had to wait for a bit for a table. Service was nice and friendly, and we were well looked after during our visit. We ordered the sausage platter and a beer flight. Food was very nice, and the beers were also really good. Prices were average for the area. We would definitely recommend overall.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 14, 2026",
