            "review_text": "TaiPanStu\nSingapore, Singapore196 contributions\n0\nSunset craft beer\nJul 2026 • Couples\nLocated right on the beach, this is a perfect place to have some beers and watch the sun go down. \n\nBrewing their own beers onsite, the large open space means there’s lots of atmosphere and plenty of tables from dining to high tables for drinks.\n\nWe didn’t sample much of the food but the sides we had - nachos and calamari - were not that great. The menu was quite large, focussing on pub food but I don’t think this is the place for a spectacular meal. \n\nThe beers however were really special. Having a good mix of larger, pilsner, ale and wheat beers, there’s something for all tastes. They also provide food pairings.\n\nStaff were friendly and the price was very good.\n\nFour stars for the beach location and the fantastic beer.\nRead more\nWritten July 23, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
